<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rodman cuts Amgen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rodman cuts Amgen.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw said analyst James Keeney downgraded Amgen Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst cited news Friday that the Amgen and Regeneron Pharmaceuticals Inc drug for treating Lou Gehrig's disease had failed to show efficacy in a Phase III trial.</p>
<p>-- Amgen was off 1-3/16 to 53-7/8.</p>
</text>
